"citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.35.490","content_hash":"7b9f10719828c125847237c704ce02082079d8a165b3ee8b257ad7d4aea71870","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.35.490:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.35.490:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.35.490","text":"“AWWA Manual” means the AWWA Manual M14, current edition, published by the American Water Works Association.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"e7019802-40cf-5e89-9e51-3ed8612f7dce"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"14.35.490","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.35.490","content_hash":"fc562255622a1816faa9c01aee94cf135b0750b52c5889ceacd3f32f4ad3ce5e","heading":null,"ordinal":6,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.35.490:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.35.490:block:6","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.35.490","text":"“Backflow and Cross Connection Enforcement Official” means the individual or individuals designated by the City Manager to enforce the City of Topeka’s backflow prevention and cross connection control program.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"e45a2db6-1494-5bb5-a0f4-67bf319c3d7e"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"14.35.490","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.35.490","content_hash":"d248d3d272e8281005a2ca9bedc462327207fee68a3504ddc84eaf797743d288","heading":null,"ordinal":7,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.35.490:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.35.490:block:7","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.35.490","text":"“Backflow license” means a document issued by the development services division to a certified backflow tester/repair technician.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"496bc3b3-050f-5607-bd42-e63212561ca1"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"14.35.490","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.35.490","content_hash":"cc37922be8e39f55aca5765405f33f561006bd7fa657690d596f46a6d8d415e4","heading":null,"ordinal":8,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.35.490:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.35.490:block:8","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.35.490","text":"“Certified backflow tester/repair technicians” means individuals who have successfully completed an accredited training session recognized by the Kansas Department of Health and Environment (KDHE) and the Backflow and Cross Connection Enforcement Official. The Development Services Division shall license the tester/repair technicians after ascertaining the technician meets specific qualifications.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"a33f485a-e775-5bb4-a500-eeb866471a25"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"14.35.490","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.35.490","content_hash":"eba65bac683db2749e53e684edce0e00664826ade51109d7a2f0d52382c2ac55","heading":null,"ordinal":9,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.35.490:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.35.490:block:9","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.35.490","text":"“CEU” means one continuing education unit which shall be earned for each one hour of actual classroom instruction.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"add935da-0528-5085-9c17-c0b0388a291c"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"14.35.490","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/14.35.490","content_hash":"9c0d97ea1f1a4